{"page":307,"verses":[{"verse_key":"19:26","surah":19,"ayah":26,"ar_uthmani":"فَكُلِى وَٱشْرَبِى وَقَرِّى عَيْنًا ۖ فَإِمَّا تَرَيِنَّ مِنَ ٱلْبَشَرِ أَحَدًا فَقُولِىٓ إِنِّى نَذَرْتُ لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ صَوْمًا فَلَنْ أُكَلِّمَ ٱلْيَوْمَ إِنسِيًّا","en_translation_id":85,"en":"so eat, drink, be glad, and say to anyone you may see: “I have vowed to the Lord of Mercy to abstain from conversation, and I will not talk to anyone today.”’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَكُلِى","en_gloss":"So eat","transliteration":"fakulī","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":2,"ar":"وَٱشْرَبِى","en_gloss":"and drink","transliteration":"wa-ish'rabī","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَقَرِّى","en_gloss":"and cool","transliteration":"waqarrī","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":4,"ar":"عَيْنًۭا ۖ","en_gloss":"(your) eyes","transliteration":"ʿaynan","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَإِمَّا","en_gloss":"And if","transliteration":"fa-immā","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":6,"ar":"تَرَيِنَّ","en_gloss":"you see","transliteration":"tarayinna","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْبَشَرِ","en_gloss":"human being","transliteration":"l-bashari","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":9,"ar":"أَحَدًۭا","en_gloss":"anyone","transliteration":"aḥadan","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":10,"ar":"فَقُولِىٓ","en_gloss":"then say","transliteration":"faqūlī","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنِّى","en_gloss":"Indeed, I","transliteration":"innī","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":12,"ar":"نَذَرْتُ","en_gloss":"[I] have vowed","transliteration":"nadhartu","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لِلرَّحْمَـٰنِ","en_gloss":"to the Most Gracious","transliteration":"lilrraḥmāni","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":14,"ar":"صَوْمًۭا","en_gloss":"a fast","transliteration":"ṣawman","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":15,"ar":"فَلَنْ","en_gloss":"so not","transliteration":"falan","verse_key":"19:26"},{"pos":16,"ar":"أُكَلِّمَ","en_gloss":"I will speak","transliteration":"ukallima","verse_key":"1