 among them","transliteration":"baynihim","verse_key":"19:37"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَوَيْلٌۭ","en_gloss":"so woe","transliteration":"fawaylun","verse_key":"19:37"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لِّلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"to those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"19:37"},{"pos":7,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"19:37"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مِن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"19:37"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مَّشْهَدِ","en_gloss":"(the) witnessing","transliteration":"mashhadi","verse_key":"19:37"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يَوْمٍ","en_gloss":"(of) a Day","transliteration":"yawmin","verse_key":"19:37"},{"pos":11,"ar":"عَظِيمٍ","en_gloss":"great","transliteration":"ʿaẓīmin","verse_key":"19:37"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٧","en_gloss":"(37)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"19:37"}]},{"verse_key":"19:38","surah":19,"ayah":38,"ar_uthmani":"أَسْمِعْ بِهِمْ وَأَبْصِرْ يَوْمَ يَأْتُونَنَا ۖ لَـٰكِنِ ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ ٱلْيَوْمَ فِى ضَلَـٰلٍ مُّبِينٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"How sharp of hearing, how sharp of sight they will be when they come to Us, although now they are clearly off course! Warn them [Muhammad] of the Day of Remorse when the matter will be decided,","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَسْمِعْ","en_gloss":"How they will hear","transliteration":"asmiʿ","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بِهِمْ","en_gloss":"How they will hear","transliteration":"bihim","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":3,"ar":"وَأَبْصِرْ","en_gloss":"and how (they will) see","transliteration":"wa-abṣir","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":4,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":5,"ar":"يَأْتُونَنَا ۖ","en_gloss":"they will come to Us","transliteration":"yatūnanā","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَـٰكِنِ","en_gloss":"but","transliteration":"lākini","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلظَّـٰلِمُونَ","en_gloss":"the wrongdoers","transliteration":"l-ẓālimūna","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلْيَوْمَ","en_gloss":"today","transliteration":"l-yawma","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِى","en_gloss":"(are) in","transliteration":"fī","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":10,"ar":"ضَلَـٰلٍۢ","en_gloss":"error","transliteration":"ḍalālin","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مُّبِينٍۢ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"mubīnin","verse_key":"19:38"},{"pos":12,"ar":"٣٨","en_gloss":"(38)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"19:38"}]}]}